  "identifier": "roentgen-v2",
  "name": "RoentGen-v2",
  "description": "Radiographic generative AI models that produce finely controllable synthetic chest X-ray data, used to improve the robustness and fairness of downstream chest X-ray interpretation models. MIT-licensed code from the Stanford MIMI Lab. Note: RoentGen-v2 is distinct from the original RoentGen repository, whose code carried no licence and whose weights were gated to MIMIC-CXR-credentialed researchers; this v2 repository is permissively licensed.",
  "url": "https://github.com/StanfordMIMI/RoentGen-v2",
  "codeRepository": "https://github.com/StanfordMIMI/RoentGen-v2",
  "license": "MIT",
