    "embedded-library"
  ],
  "mach:intendedUse": "A research tool for generating controllable synthetic chest X-rays to augment and de-bias training data for interpretation models — not for producing images presented as real clinical studies.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-11-22",
  "schema:comment": "Generated images are synthetic and must not be presented as genuine patient radiographs. Weights-release and training-data details to be confirmed from the repository and the associated paper.",
